<title>USA: American Nortel to buy back 400,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>American Nortel to buy back 400,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Nortel Communications Inc said Tuesday its board approved the repurchase of up to 400,000 common shares.</p>
<p>The timing and terms of the repurchases will be determined by management based on market conditions.  American Nortel Communications had 8.8 million common shares outstanding as of Dec. 31, 1996.</p>
